{{!
    @template tool_vae/whereami_tree

    The panel "where am I" of one record: its title, the way to the self-positioning, then each node of the tree, set in by
    its level, with its level name and its label (in the label of a box tags[] when the page asks for boxes), then either the
    reason it cannot be positioned on or the vaeiste's own level, and the counts of its own with the way to what carries it;
    then, apart, the ranks that carry something but left the record. The parts of a line touch: the template holds on one
    logical line, each break carried by a comment. Nothing at all when panel is null.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\whereami_tree. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except one key:
    * labelhtml - the label of a node, given by format_string() of the core (already HTML, as before)

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * panel - object or null:
      * title - object or null: text, the title of the panel
      * selfposlink - object or null: url and text, the way to the self-positioning
      * nodes - array of {level, style, rank, node, gone}: node is an object (levelname, labelhtml, box: object (id, value,
        checked) or null, explain: object (text) or null, selfpos: object (words) or null, count: object (words, inverse:
        object (url, text) or null) or null); gone is null
      * gone - object or null: heading, and items, an array of {level, style, rank, node, gone}: node is null, gone is an
        object (rank, count as above)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "panel": {
            "title": {"text": "Where I stand"},
            "selfposlink": {
                "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/selfposition.php?userid=7&fiche=RNCP400",
                "text": "Position myself"
            },
            "nodes": [
                {
                    "level": "1", "style": "margin-left: 0rem", "rank": "",
                    "node": {
                        "levelname": "Record", "labelhtml": "Accompany the person", "box": null, "explain": null,
                        "selfpos": {"words": "No level given yet"},
                        "count": {"words": "0 situation(s), 0 declaration(s)", "inverse": null}
                    },
                    "gone": null
                },
                {
                    "level": "2", "style": "margin-left: 1.5rem", "rank": "D1",
                    "node": {
                        "levelname": "Level 2", "labelhtml": "Domain 1",
                        "box": {"id": "tool-vae-whereami-tag-D1", "value": "D1", "checked": true}, "explain": null,
                        "selfpos": {"words": "No level given yet"},
                        "count": {
                            "words": "1 situation(s), 0 declaration(s)",
                            "inverse": {
                                "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/situations.php?userid=7&fiche=RNCP400&rank=D1",
                                "text": "See"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "gone": null
                },
                {
                    "level": "2", "style": "margin-left: 1.5rem", "rank": "AS-1-1",
                    "node": {
                        "levelname": "Level 2", "labelhtml": "Odd coded skill", "box": null,
                        "explain": {"text": "This element cannot be positioned on."}, "selfpos": null, "count": null
                    },
                    "gone": null
                }
            ],
            "gone": {
                "heading": "Written on elements that left the record",
                "items": [
                    {
                        "level": "1", "style": "margin-left: 0rem", "rank": "C99", "node": null,
                        "gone": {"rank": "C99", "count": {"words": "0 situation(s), 1 declaration(s)", "inverse": null} }
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    }
}}
{{#panel}}<section class="tool-vae-whereami">{{#title}}<h4 class="h5">{{text}}</h4>{{/title}}{{!
}}{{#selfposlink}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/selfposlink}}{{!
}}<ul class="list-unstyled tool-vae-whereami-tree">{{#nodes}}{{!
}}<li class="tool-vae-whereami-node level-{{level}}" style="{{style}}" data-level="{{level}}" data-rank="{{rank}}">{{!
}}{{#node}}{{#box}}{{!
}}<input type="checkbox" name="tags[]" value="{{value}}" id="{{id}}" class="me-2"{{!
}}{{#checked}} checked="checked"{{/checked}} />{{!
}}<label for="{{id}}">{{/box}}{{!
}}<span class="small text-muted me-2">{{levelname}}</span><strong>{{{labelhtml}}}</strong>{{#box}}</label>{{/box}}{{!
}}{{#explain}} <span class="small text-muted">{{text}}</span>{{/explain}}{{!
}}{{#selfpos}} - {{words}}{{/selfpos}}{{!
}}{{#count}} - <span class="small">{{words}}</span>{{!
}}{{#inverse}} <a class="small" href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a>{{/inverse}}{{/count}}{{!
}}{{/node}}</li>{{/nodes}}</ul>{{!
}}{{#gone}}<h5 class="h6">{{heading}}</h5><ul class="list-unstyled tool-vae-whereami-gone">{{#items}}{{!
}}<li class="tool-vae-whereami-node level-{{level}}" style="{{style}}" data-level="{{level}}" data-rank="{{rank}}">{{!
}}{{#gone}}<strong>{{rank}}</strong>{{!
}}{{#count}} - <span class="small">{{words}}</span>{{!
}}{{#inverse}} <a class="small" href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a>{{/inverse}}{{/count}}{{!
}}{{/gone}}</li>{{/items}}</ul>{{/gone}}</section>{{/panel}}
